          <details><summary>Is the team store really free?</summary><p>Yes. Creating your store is free, with no setup fee or upfront inventory purchase. Your members pay for the gear they choose to order.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Why do I need to sign in?</summary><p>Secure Shopify sign-in connects your store to your dashboard so you can manage it and return later. After signing in, you come back to the short setup form.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Do I have to collect sizes or payments?</summary><p>No. Share your store's join link. Each person signs in, chooses their own size and color, and pays for their own order. We ship directly to them.</p></details>
